{"3892100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Classroom Reverie", "steam_appid": 3892100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bell rang, but your mind had already left the classroom. The blank pages of a lined notebook became your new reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Classroom Reverie&quot; is a 2D platformer with tight controls and fluid gameplay. It's an atmospheric, hand-drawn journey through a student's mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHANGING WORLDS, CHANGING RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core concept of this game is that each level has its own unique core mechanic. This isn't a single game, but a combination of six different platforming challenges. To progress, you'll need to master all six rules of the six courses:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb into the world of Literature, where words take on physical meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Painting, use the world's colors like a key to uncover hidden paths beyond perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Math, push the limits of momentum by instantly rewriting the equation of your motion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Science, manipulate the states of matter and twist your surroundings; transform solids into vapors, and voids into passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Music, solve harmony puzzles and progress as one with the rhythm of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Philosophy, navigate a chaos where the rules of reality are bent, logic and space are relative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCEPT THE CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game of skill, requiring tight controls and precision. For those who seek true mastery, each level contains brutally challenging secret chambers that preserve the student's lost memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind has created this world. Can you stop it from returning everything to the void from which it began?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bell rang, but your mind had already left the classroom. The blank pages of a lined notebook became your new reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Classroom Reverie&quot; is a 2D platformer with tight controls and fluid gameplay. It's an atmospheric, hand-drawn journey through a student's mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHANGING WORLDS, CHANGING RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core concept of this game is that each level has its own unique core mechanic. This isn't a single game, but a combination of six different platforming challenges. To progress, you'll need to master all six rules of the six courses:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb into the world of Literature, where words take on physical meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Painting, use the world's colors like a key to uncover hidden paths beyond perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Math, push the limits of momentum by instantly rewriting the equation of your motion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Science, manipulate the states of matter and twist your surroundings; transform solids into vapors, and voids into passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Music, solve harmony puzzles and progress as one with the rhythm of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Philosophy, navigate a chaos where the rules of reality are bent, logic and space are relative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCEPT THE CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game of skill, requiring tight controls and precision. For those who seek true mastery, each level contains brutally challenging secret chambers that preserve the student's lost memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind has created this world. Can you stop it from returning everything to the void from which it began?</p>", "short_description": "A hand-drawn, 2D precision platformer set in a student's notebook. Traverse six distinct subject themes, each with a unique core mechanic, in a world where your doodles come to life. Defend this world created by your mind from a threat that seeks to turn it into a void.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892100/71d9ce869fc987940363bf2197279c74f2562e22/header.jpg?t=1764377327", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892100/25488a912fc1b50465daded63169cb37670289f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764377327", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892100/25488a912fc1b50465daded63169cb37670289f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764377327", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6320 (2*1866) <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10 uyumlu herhangi bir kart<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 434 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["TokAyı Games"], "publishers": ["TokAyı Games"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 399, "final": 399, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$3.99"}, "packages": [1368117], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Classroom Reverie", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 136